---
description: Next.js App Router rules
globs:
  - "app/**/*"
  - "components/**/*"
---

# Next.js

- Use Next.js App Router only.
- Prefer Server Components.
- Add "use client" only when required.
- Fetch data on the server whenever possible.
- Use route handlers under app/api.
- Keep reusable business logic inside lib/.

# Images

Use:

- next/image

Never add unoptimized large images.

# Navigation

Use:

- next/link

for internal routes.